#
# Conformance case: common-logic/existential.
#
# ISO 24707 (Common Logic) example — an existentially quantified conjunction:
#   CLIF:  (exists (x) (and (Cat x) (On x Mat)))
# "Something is a cat and is on the mat." Encoded as the canonical logic: full-FOL
# Formula AST (an Exists over an And of a unary and a binary atom). Gates the
# CLIF/CGIF/XCL Exact projections: IR round-trip isomorphism + cross-dialect equivalence.

